<title>USA: LSB Financial to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>LSB Financial to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSB Financial Corp said Thursday it plans to buy back five percent of its stock.</p>
<p>The bank holding company said it will repurchase the stock in the open market.</p>
<p>In July, the company completed a separate repurchase of 48,235 shares, or five percent of its stock, during a one-month period.</p>
<p>LSB Financial is the parent of Lafayette Savings Bank.</p>
<p>		-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
